  "title": "Minute Steaks with Barbecue Butter Sauce",
  "description": "Of all the minute steak recipes, you'll want to save this one. With a savory pan sauce made from beef broth, BBQ sauce, and butter, it's out of this world!",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2012-04-13T17:20:40-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-03-19T06:30:49-04:00",
